<title>HONG KONG: HK air cargo for non-Asian destinations in Feb 97.</title>
<headline>HK air cargo for non-Asian destinations in Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frankfurt remained the most important European destination for air cargo exports and imports from Hong Kong, while Anchorage was the leading US destination, statistics published for February by Hong Kong's Civil Aviation Department show.</p>
